    "name": "Spearphishing Voice - BazarCall Callback Phishing",
    "description": "Victim receives phishing email claiming subscription charge, calls attacker-provided number, and is guided to install RMM tool (AnyDesk/TeamViewer/ScreenConnect) for 'support'. Real campaigns: BazarCall (BazarLoader delivery), Luna Moth (data extortion), Royal ransomware (callback phishing to BatLoader). Detection: RMM tool installation from browser download shortly after suspicious email.",
